      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 935: 🟡 `invitationCandidates()` builds `uris` with `push_back` but never de-duplicates newly collected targets. If the same member appears across multiple selected source conversations, `inviteToConversation()` will call `addConversationMember()` multiple times for the same URI, causing redundant requests and inflated invite counts. Build `uris` through a set (or add each accepted URI to a seen set) before returning.",
      "revId": "80687d5486f6002e95c236015683cdf4494687ee",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
